        <description>text template for when multiple records are records found</description>
        <name>multipleRecordsFoundTextTemplate</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Hello {!OrganizationName} Admin, 

The BES Outbound Retry process is configured to start when a Backend Exception handling platform event message occurs. A Backend Exception handling message occurred, but the process didn&apos;t start because multiple records in your org match the values specified in the process&apos;s Object node.

Here are the values from the Backend Exception handling message.
Error Log Id: {!myVariable_myEvent.Core_IPS_Error_Log_Id__c}

To fix this issue, adjust the matching filters in the process&apos;s Object node.

Thank you, 
Salesforce Process Automation</text>
    </textTemplates>
